  {
   "id": "cryptical-path-270542@major-2024-11-25",
   "gameId": "cryptical-path-270542",
   "displayName": "Cryptical Path Release Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-11-25T14:41:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings, adventurers! 🗺️⚔️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re thrilled to officially announce that Cryptical Path, the first-ever Roguelite Builder, is coming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Originally set for winter 2024, Cryptical Path will now be released in early 2025.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This journey has been all about crafting an epic roguelike experience where you don’t just survive the dungeon—you build it. With the Hexium Map, intense battles, and endless strategies to explore, we can’t wait for you to dive in and start forging your path.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The team is hard at work polishing the game to ensure it’s everything you’re hoping for—and more. Your patience and support mean the world to us, and we promise it’ll be worth the wait.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more updates, sneak peeks, and devlogs as we get closer to launch. And don’t forget to wishlist Cryptical Path to be notified the moment it’s available!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for being part of this adventure. See you in the dungeon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🏴‍☠️ The Old Skull Games Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
